<http://data.silknow.org/object/e6931b3e-bf92-3d22-be3d-363d8cd44de3/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "At the bottom in a horizontal band are two animals, possibly Angnus Dei, and a bunch of grapes, with a narrow border all around of angular vine-stems. In the middle is a drawn work panel of lozenge design enclosing a lion, birds and plants. The lace has repeating 'S' and heart-shaped devices."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/e6931b3e-bf92-3d22-be3d-363d8cd44de3> .

